---

The Gullet is a district of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], further down the river from the jewelers' quarter, near where the water drops the rubbish it carries through the city. It is a poorer part of the city. Its buildings are run down, with cracked tile floors and hallways where one bulb in three is dead or flickering, and people sit on the floor in the open, far gone on narcotics. The neighbours keep to themselves and do not watch one another.

A man in a black raiment keeps an apartment in the Gullet.
